<title>DENMARK: SOCCER-DANISH SUPER LEAGUE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DANISH SUPER LEAGUE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of soccer match in the</p>
<p>Danish super league over the weekend.</p>
<p>Silkeborg   1  Hvidovre	1</p>
<p>Standings (tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost, goals  for,</p>
<p>against, points):</p>
<p> Brondby	 6    6   0    0  15   4   18</p>
<p> Aalborg	 5    4   0    1  14   4   12</p>
<p> Aarhus	  6    3   1    2  13  10   10</p>
<p> Lyngby	  6    3   0    3  13  13    9</p>
<p> Silkeborg     5    2   2    1   8   7    8</p>
<p> FC Copenhagen 6    2   2    2   9   9    8</p>
<p> Hvidovre	6    1   3    2   5   6    6</p>
<p> Odense	  6    2   0    4   7  12    6</p>
<p> Herfoelge     6    2   0    4   3  10    6</p>
<p> Vejle	   6    1   2    3  10  10    5</p>
<p> AB		6    1   2    3   8  14    5</p>
<p> Viborg	  6    1   2    3   6  12    5</p>
